---
import AppShell from '../components/layout/AppShell.astro';
import KpiCard from '../components/layout/KpiCard.astro';
import MacroChartsIsland from '../components/islands/MacroChartsIsland';
---

<AppShell title="Executive Macro & Market Mindmap" activePath="/">
  <div class="space-y-6">
    <!-- Header Page Description -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-2 border-b border-[var(--border-default)] pb-4">
      <div>
        <h1 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[var(--text-primary)]">
          Malang Coffee Shop &amp; Kopi Susu Market Intelligence Workstation
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-[var(--text-secondary)] mt-0.5">
          Sintesis Analitik Berbasis 93 Brand Komersial (176 Outlet), 157 Titik Kafe OSM, Model Ekonometrika OLS (R² = 0.7407), dan Simulasi Monte Carlo 12 Bulan.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <a
          href="/explorer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded bg-[var(--accent-base)] text-white hover:bg-[var(--accent-hover)] transition-colors"
        >
          <span>Buka 93-Brand Explorer</span>
          <span>→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Row 1: 4 KPI Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
      <KpiCard
        title="City-Wide Kopi Susu TAM"
        value="72.600 cup/hari"
        badgeText="Rp 495B–540B / thn"
        badgeVariant="info"
        footnote="Estimasi 1.450 outlet Malang Raya (64.4% pangsa minuman kopi)"
        href="/analytics"
      />
      <KpiCard
        title="Sample Kopi Susu Volume"
        value="25.570 cup/hari"
        badgeText="9.33 Juta cup / thn"
        badgeVariant="success"
        footnote="Total 93 brand komersial (176 outlet fisik terverifikasi)"
        href="/explorer"
      />
      <KpiCard
        title="OLS Demand Predictor"
        value="R² = 74,1%"
        badgeText="Adj R² 72,6%"
        badgeVariant="warning"
        footnote="ln(Reviews) t = +5.64, 24H t = +4.52, Harga/1k t = -3.78"
        href="/analytics"
      />
      <KpiCard
        title="Top ROI Format (Monte Carlo)"
        value="418,9% / thn"
        badgeText="Payback 4 Bulan"
        badgeVariant="success"
        footnote="Format B: Modern Heritage Kopitiam (Capex Rp 160 Juta)"
        href="/simulator"
      />
    </div>

    <!-- Row 1.5: TAM / SAM / SOM Market Sizing Architecture -->
    <div class="bg-[var(--bg-surface)] border border-[var(--border-default)] rounded-xl p-5 shadow-[0_1px_3px_0_rgba(15,23,42,0.03)] space-y-4">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-2 border-b border-slate-100 pb-3">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)]">
            Struktur Ukuran Pasar F&amp;B Kopi Kota Malang (TAM / SAM / SOM)
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)] mt-0.5">
            Dikalibrasi dari data demografi BPS Kota Malang (846.126 penduduk) dan 221.000 mahasiswa aktif 9 perguruan tinggi
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[11px] font-mono font-medium text-slate-500 bg-slate-100 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">
          Basis Populasi: 1.067.000 jiwa
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-xs">
        <div class="bg-slate-50/80 p-4 rounded-xl space-y-1.5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Total Addressable Market (TAM)</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-blue-700 bg-blue-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">100% Seluruh F&amp;B Kopi</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xl font-bold font-mono text-slate-900 num-tabular">
            112.700 <span class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-500">cup/hari</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Estimasi total perputaran minuman kopi di 1.450+ warung kopi tradisional, warkop, kafe modern, dan jaringan nasional se-Malang Raya. Nilai pasar: <strong class="text-slate-800">Rp 780 Miliar / tahun</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-50/80 p-4 rounded-xl space-y-1.5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Serviceable Addressable Market (SAM)</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">64.4% Kopi Susu Segmen</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xl font-bold font-mono text-[var(--accent-base)] num-tabular">
            72.600 <span class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-500">cup/hari</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Konsumsi spesifik Kopi Susu (Aren, Butter, Creamy, Macchiato) berbasis espresso machine &amp; mokapot. Nilai pasar terlayani: <strong class="text-slate-800">Rp 495 Miliar – Rp 540 Miliar / tahun</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-50/80 p-4 rounded-xl space-y-1.5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Serviceable Obtainable Market (SOM)</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-amber-800 bg-amber-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">22.7% Korpus 93 Brand</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xl font-bold font-mono text-slate-900 num-tabular">
            25.570 <span class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-500">cup/hari</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Pangsa pasar langsung yang dikuasai 93 brand komersial (176 outlet fisik) terverifikasi dalam riset ini. Nilai omzet riil: <strong class="text-slate-800">Rp 174 Miliar / tahun</strong> (9,33 Juta cup/thn).
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Row 2: Interactive Macro Charts Island -->
    <MacroChartsIsland client:visible />

    <!-- Row 2.5: Daypart Peak Traffic Dynamics -->
    <div class="bg-[var(--bg-surface)] border border-[var(--border-default)] rounded-xl p-5 shadow-[0_1px_3px_0_rgba(15,23,42,0.03)] space-y-4">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-2 border-b border-slate-100 pb-3">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)]">
            Dinamika Pola Konsumsi Kopi Susu Berdasarkan Waktu (Daypart Traffic Windows)
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)] mt-0.5">
            Analisis 3 jendela waktu transaksi untuk mengoptimasi rotasi barista dan strategi promosi
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-xs">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-blue-50/50 border border-blue-100/80 space-y-2">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="font-bold text-blue-900">06:30 – 09:30 · Morning Rush</span>
            <span class="font-mono font-bold text-blue-700 bg-blue-100/70 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px]">22% Volume</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Didominasi pekerja kantor, PNS, dan komuter residensial (Sawojajar &amp; Sulfat) serta sarapan kopitiam di Kayutangan. Durasi transaksi <strong class="text-slate-900">&lt; 3 menit</strong> dengan AOV Rp 18.000 (Grab &amp; Go) hingga Rp 32.000 (Kopitiam + Roti).
          </p>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-blue-800 pt-1 font-medium">
            Kunci Sukses: Sistem POS cepat, bundling roti/snack pagi, cup sealer anti tumpah.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-50/50 border border-amber-100/80 space-y-2">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="font-bold text-amber-900">13:00 – 17:30 · WFC &amp; Nugas</span>
            <span class="font-mono font-bold text-amber-800 bg-amber-100/70 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px]">38% Volume</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Puncak kedatangan mahasiswa pengerja tugas, skripsi, dan pekerja remote di koridor Lowokwaru (Suhat/Watugong). Durasi duduk sangat panjang (<strong class="text-slate-900">2,5 s/d 4,5 jam per kursi</strong>), memicu risiko RevPASH rendah.
          </p>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-amber-800 pt-1 font-medium">
            Kunci Sukses: Stopkontak melimpah, Wi-Fi 75–100 Mbps stabil, upselling cemilan sharing.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50/50 border border-emerald-100/80 space-y-2">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="font-bold text-emerald-900">19:00 – 02:00+ · Night Social &amp; Kalong</span>
            <span class="font-mono font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-100/70 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px]">40% Volume</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Penyumbang volume terbesar di format 24 jam (Kopi Studio 24, Nakoa, Bento Kopi, Semusim). Bebas tekanan durasi kerja laptop, didominasi nongkrong kelompok dengan <em>food attachment</em> tinggi (mie, kentang, cireng).
          </p>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-emerald-800 pt-1 font-medium">
            Kunci Sukses: Kapasitas kursi &gt; 150 seat, keamanan parkir motor larut malam, playlist santai.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Row 2.75: 5-Corridor Micro-Market Deep-Dive -->
    <div class="bg-[var(--bg-surface)] border border-[var(--border-default)] rounded-xl p-5 shadow-[0_1px_3px_0_rgba(15,23,42,0.03)] space-y-4">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-2 border-b border-slate-100 pb-3">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)]">
            Karakteristik &amp; Peta Koridor Mikro Kota Malang
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)] mt-0.5">
            Komparasi biaya sewa, profil konsumen, dan tingkat risiko musiman akademik antar-kecamatan
          </p>
        </div>
        <a href="/explorer" class="text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--accent-base)] hover:underline">
          Lihat persebaran di Peta Spasial →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-5 gap-3 text-xs">
        <div class="bg-slate-50/80 p-3.5 rounded-xl space-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <strong class="text-slate-900 font-bold">1. Lowokwaru</strong>
              <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-blue-700 font-semibold">50 Brand</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 block">Suhat, Sigura-gura, MT Haryono</span>
            <p class="text-slate-600 mt-2 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
              Zona <em>hyper-red ocean</em>. Sewa ruko tertinggi (Rp 85M–160M/thn). Sangat rentan libur semester (-28% s/d -35%).
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-200/60 text-[10px] text-slate-500">
            Karakter: <strong class="text-slate-800">Mahasiswa Nugas</strong>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-50/80 p-3.5 rounded-xl space-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <strong class="text-slate-900 font-bold">2. Klojen</strong>
              <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-emerald-700 font-semibold">26 Brand</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 block">Kayutangan, Stasiun, Ijen</span>
            <p class="text-slate-600 mt-2 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
              Kluster cagar budaya &amp; turis akhir pekan. Format kopitiam modern mencetak ROI tercepat (payback 4 bulan) dan margin kotor 74%.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-200/60 text-[10px] text-slate-500">
            Karakter: <strong class="text-slate-800">Turis &amp; Heritage</strong>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-50/80 p-3.5 rounded-xl space-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <strong class="text-slate-900 font-bold">3. Sawojajar</strong>
              <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-amber-700 font-semibold">6 Brand</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 block">Danau Toba, Velodrome</span>
            <p class="text-slate-600 mt-2 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
              Dipimpin oleh <strong>Haya Espresso Bar</strong>, Easy Breezy, SWAG, dan Daily Dose. Bebas dari guncangan libur kampus, perputaran komuter stabil.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-200/60 text-[10px] text-slate-500">
            Karakter: <strong class="text-slate-800">Komuter Residensial</strong>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-50/80 p-3.5 rounded-xl space-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <strong class="text-slate-900 font-bold">4. Blimbing</strong>
              <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-purple-700 font-semibold">4 Brand</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 block">Sulfat Raya, Koridor Araya</span>
            <p class="text-slate-600 mt-2 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
              Kawasan perumahan mapan daya beli tinggi. Sensitivitas harga rendah (Rp 22k–35k). Syarat mutlak: area parkir mobil minimal 8–10 slot.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-200/60 text-[10px] text-slate-500">
            Karakter: <strong class="text-slate-800">Keluarga &amp; Mid-High</strong>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-50/80 p-3.5 rounded-xl space-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <strong class="text-slate-900 font-bold">5. Sukun</strong>
              <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-rose-700 font-semibold">4 Brand</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 block">S. Supriadi, Unikama</span>
            <p class="text-slate-600 mt-2 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
              Segmen harga sensitif (price ceiling Rp 12k–14k). Margin tipis volume moderat, membutuhkan kontrol biaya bahan baku sangat ketat.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-200/60 text-[10px] text-slate-500">
            Karakter: <strong class="text-slate-800">Budget Kampus Selatan</strong>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Row 3: Strategic Executive Takeaways -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-xs">
      <div class="bg-[var(--bg-surface)] border border-[var(--border-default)] rounded-xl p-5 shadow-[0_1px_3px_0_rgba(15,23,42,0.03)] hover:border-slate-300 transition-all">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--accent-base)]"></span>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-xs text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase tracking-wider">
            1. Arbitrase Koridor Komuter (Sawojajar &amp; Sulfat)
          </h4>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
          Kawasan Lowokwaru berada di zona <span class="font-medium text-slate-800">hyper-red ocean</span> (50 brand / 53.8% pangsa) dengan risiko penurunan drastis saat libur semester (Juli–Agustus &amp; Januari–Februari). Koridor <strong class="text-slate-900">Sawojajar (Danau Toba / Velodrome)</strong> yang dipimpin oleh <strong class="text-slate-900">Haya Espresso Bar, Easy Breezy, SWAG, Uma, dan Daily Dose</strong> menawarkan perputaran stabil harian dari segmen keluarga, pekerja lokal, dan komuter residensial mandiri tanpa guncangan kalender akademik.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[var(--bg-surface)] border border-[var(--border-default)] rounded-xl p-5 shadow-[0_1px_3px_0_rgba(15,23,42,0.03)] hover:border-slate-300 transition-all">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--status-success-mark)]"></span>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-xs text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase tracking-wider">
            2. Keunggulan Unit Economics Kopitiam (Format B)
          </h4>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
          Simulasi Monte Carlo (5.000 iterasi x 24 bulan) membuktikan <strong class="text-slate-900">Format B (Modern Heritage Kopitiam)</strong> mencetak probabilitas defisit bulanan <strong class="text-emerald-700">0.0%</strong> dengan Annual Net Profit P50 sebesar <strong class="text-slate-900">Rp 670,17 Juta</strong> dan payback dalam <strong class="text-emerald-700">4 bulan</strong>. Daya ungkit margin diperoleh dari HPP Kopi Susu Butter (margin kotor 74%) serta <em>food attach</em> tinggi (roti srikaya, telur setengah matang, mie).
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[var(--bg-surface)] border border-[var(--border-default)] rounded-xl p-5 shadow-[0_1px_3px_0_rgba(15,23,42,0.03)] hover:border-slate-300 transition-all">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--status-danger-mark)]"></span>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-xs text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase tracking-wider">
            3. Peringatan Erosi Margin GoFood &amp; ShopeeFood
          </h4>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
          Skema komisi agregator (20% + Rp 1.000) dan beban subsidi promo merchant (10%–20%) mengikis margin bersih hingga di bawah Rp 4.000 per cup jika harga aplikasi tidak dinaikkan minimal <strong class="text-rose-700">25%–28%</strong> di atas harga <em>dine-in</em>. Operator wajib mengoptimalkan paket bundling / literan 1L guna mendongkrak AOV ke atas Rp 50.000.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</AppShell>
